OL,3,GNEWSA'The man who drugged and raped me
OL,4,Awas freed from prison and went on to
OL,5,Akill'
OL,6,
OL,7,FA man who drugged multiple women over a
OL,8,F40-year period and eventually killed
OL,9,Fhis partner should never have been
OL,10,Freleased from prison, according to one
OL,11,Fof his victims.
OL,13,FRichard Scatchard was jailed twice but
OL,14,Freleased from prison on licence in
OL,15,F2013.
OL,17,FHe went on to kill Kelly Faiers in
OL,18,F2023, by coercing her into taking
OL,19,Fsleeping tablets after drinking
OL,20,Falcohol.
